allbacks":{"taskFinished":{"{$request.body#/webhook_url}":{"post":{"description":"Sent once the task finishes; retried with backoff (30s, 2m,\n10m, 30m, 1h…) until a 2xx response or the attempt limit.\n\n- `task.succeeded`: the body is the file itself.\n- `task.failed`: the body is a JSON `WebhookFailedEvent`.\n\n**Verifying the signature.** Compute the hex SHA-256 of the raw\nbody and compare it with `X-Ytdl-Content-Sha256`. Then take\n`t` and `v1` from `X-Ytdl-Signature` and check that\n`v1 == hex(HMAC-SHA256(webhook_secret, t + \".\" + task_id + \".\" + content_sha256))`\nand that `t` is recent (e.g. within 5 minutes). Your webhook\nsecret is at `GET /v1/me/webhook-secret`.\n","parameters":[{"$ref":"#/components/parameters/WebhookTaskID"},{"$ref":"#/components/parameters/WebhookEvent"},{"$ref":"#/components/parameters/WebhookContentSHA256"},{"$ref":"#/components/parameters/WebhookSignature"},{"description":"URL-encoded media title (succeeded events only).","in":"header","name":"X-Ytdl-Title","schema":{"type":"string"}}],"requestBody":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/WebhookFailedEvent"}},"audio/mpeg":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Binary"}},"audio/wav":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Binary"}},"video/mp4":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Binary"}}},"required":true},"responses":{"2XX":{"description":"Delivery accepted; no retry."},"default":{"description":"Any other answer (or a timeout) is retried."}},"summary":"Task result delivered to the webhook"}}}},"description":"Queues the retrieval of `url` (a link) or `name` (a search query; its\nfirst result is used) and returns immediately. When both are given,\n`url` wins. Poll `status_url`, then\ndownload `file_url` until `expires_at` (one hour after completion by\ndefault). With `webhook_url`, the file is also POSTed there when ready\n(see the callback). Webhook URLs must be public http(s) addresses.\n\nIdempotent: with `Idempotency-Key`, a repeat returns 